# zippy-standards (ZS-025): pin line endings so scripts and hooks behave the
# same on every OS. Shell scripts and hooks must be LF or sh cannot run them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
